00:10:30.562 --> 00:10:32.631
Widespread masks wearing
along with testing,

00:10:32.631 --> 00:10:34.967
contact tracing and isolation
is one of a few

00:10:34.967 --> 00:10:36.969
simple measures that could
very possibly help us

00:10:36.969 --> 00:10:38.737
